Relighting demo scene (demo-scene.ply)

What it is: a small 3D Gaussian Splatting scene (a chequered floor, two spheres and a
column; about 34,000 splats, 5.5 MB) that is computed by demo/make_demo_scene.py. It is
not a photograph or a capture and contains no third-party data. The baked lighting in it
is a simple "light from above" shading, written by the script.

